  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Slow West Vultures**: back after 24 archived shows (736 days) [3]\n- **September 15, 1983**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Orange Ball of Love**: back after 33 archived shows (853 days); rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Orange Ball of Hate/new song**: back after 86 archived shows (3024 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2007-11-02.aud.flacf** (recommended): audience recording; 16 songs; 72 min; rated 2/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: The recording contains unbearable amounts of talking, including entire cell phone conversations [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The public address system cut out during the third song, which was not a recording flaw [1]\n- John Darnielle stepped away from the microphone to sing unamplified during multiple songs [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2007-11-02.aud.flacf**: source: Church-Audio STC-11 cards > Church-Audio STC-9100 preamp > MT2496 (16 bit 44 khz) [1]",
